{{define "subject"}}Confirm your email address for rss{{end}}

{{define "text" -}}
Hi {{.Name}},

Welcome to rss! Confirm your email address by opening this link:

{{.URL}}

The link works for 7 days. Confirming makes sure we can reach you if you ever need to reset your password.

If you didn't sign up for rss, you can ignore this email.

{{template "text-footer"}}
{{- end}}

{{define "html" -}}
{{template "html-start"}}
<p>Hi {{.Name}},</p>
<p>Welcome to rss! Confirm your email address by opening this link:</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0"><a href="{{.URL}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#111318;color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Confirm email address</a></p>
<p style="color:#59636e;font-size:14px;word-break:break-all">Or paste this link into your browser: {{.URL}}</p>
<p>The link works for 7 days. Confirming makes sure we can reach you if you ever need to reset your password.</p>
<p>If you didn't sign up for rss, you can ignore this email.</p>
{{template "html-end"}}
{{- end}}
